# ScreenCloud

> Enterprise digital signage software, built for scale. ScreenCloud helps organizations boost productivity, improve communication, and engage employees across every location — powering internal comms, frontline and deskless communication, real-time dashboards, and customer-facing displays from one cloud platform.

Trusted by 10,000+ organizations worldwide, including Coca-Cola Consolidated, Ricoh UK, Orbia, and Beiersdorf. Purpose-built for enterprise and multi-location deployments: centrally manage thousands of screens, with mission-critical reliability for frontline and deskless teams. Hardware-agnostic across Windows, macOS, ChromeOS, Android, WebOS, Fire OS, BrightSign, and Tizen, with purpose-built ScreenCloud OS hardware. SOC 2 Type 2 audited, Cyber Essentials certified, GDPR compliant. Founded 2015, serving customers globally.

Key facts:

- Pricing starts from $20/month per screen, scaling from a single screen to enterprise fleets.
- 80+ ready-to-go apps plus dashboards and integrations (Slack, Microsoft Teams, Power BI, Salesforce, and more) — usable without technical expertise.
- Dedicated professional support and customer success on all plans, with onboarding and professional services for enterprise rollouts.
