## Core Product & Features

- [ScreenCloud - Digital Signage Software](https://screencloud.com/): Brand overview, core mission, and the main capabilities of the platform.
- [ScreenCloud Studio](https://screencloud.com/studio): The content management system — create, schedule, and manage what plays on every screen from one place.
- [Digital Signage Hardware](https://screencloud.com/hardware): Compatible media players, commercial displays, and tablets for any signage setup.
- [ScreenCloud Pixi](https://screencloud.com/pixi): Compact, affordable plug-and-play media player built on Android. $65 per device.
- [ScreenCloud OS](https://screencloud.com/os): Purpose-built signage operating system, pre-installed on the Station P1 Pro player ($199/device) — plug-and-play, plays cached content during outages, with built-in Remote Device Management.
- [Supported Hardware](https://screencloud.com/supported-hardware): Full list of devices and operating systems officially supported by ScreenCloud.
- [Remote Device Management](https://screencloud.com/remote-device-management): Monitor, update, and troubleshoot every screen remotely from a single cloud dashboard.
- [Download ScreenCloud](https://screencloud.com/download): Player apps for each supported operating system.
- [ScreenCloud Apps](https://screencloud.com/apps): 80+ ready-to-go apps for internal comms (Slack, Teams, SharePoint, Staffbase), live feeds, social, and BI — plus the Playgrounds app for custom builds.
- [ScreenCloud Dashboards](https://screencloud.com/dashboards): Securely display Salesforce, Power BI, Grafana, Tableau, Jira, Looker Studio, Zendesk, GitHub, and Trello dashboards — credentials encrypted in the cloud, never on the device.
- [ScreenCloud Integrations](https://screencloud.com/integrations): Connect ScreenCloud with the business tools your teams already use.

